.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH mdmc-pick 1  "pick " 
.SH NAME
mdmc\-pick \- Pick a draft, snapshot, message, or address (interactive)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmdmc pick\fR [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Pick a draft, snapshot, message, or address (interactive)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Path to config.toml (default ~/.config/mdmc/config.toml)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
mdmc\-pick\-drafts(1)
Pick a draft and print its path
.TP
mdmc\-pick\-snapshots(1)
Pick a snapshot and print its path
.TP
mdmc\-pick\-msgs(1)
Pick a message and print its message\-id
.TP
mdmc\-pick\-addr(1)
Pick an address and print `Name <email>`
